</td>
                <td style="width: 95px; height: 61px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Variable</p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 119px; height: 61px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Zonular dialysis without a spherical lens</p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 128px; height: 61px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Absence of spherical, thickened lens</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 48px;">
                <td style="width: 137.461px; height: 48px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
