<p>Homocystinuria</p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 127.539px; height: 48px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Developmental delay and thrombotic risk</p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 114px; height: 48px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Inferonasal lens subluxation</p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 95px; height: 48px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Variable</p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 119px; height: 48px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Systemic metabolic features</p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 128px; height: 48px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Elevated homocysteine levels</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 48px;">
                <td style="width: 137.461px; height: 48px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Primary angle-closure&#x000a0;glaucoma</p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 127.539px; height: 48px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Acute pain and halos</p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 114px; height: 48px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Normal lens size</p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 95px; height: 48px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Shallow</p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 119px; height: 48px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Age-related</p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 128px; height: 48px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>No spherical lens morphology</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 48px;">
                <td style="width: 137.461px; height: 48px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Nanophthalmos</p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 127.539px; height: 48px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Small eye and hyperopia</p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 114px; height: 48px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Normal lens</p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 95px; height: 48px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Extremely shallow</p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 119px; height: 48px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Short axial length</p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 128px; height: 48px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Axial length markedly&#x000a0;reduced</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 61px;">
                <td style="width: 137.461px; height: 61px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Anterior lenticonus</p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 127.539px; height: 61px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Progressive visual distortion</p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 114px; height: 61px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Cone-shaped anterior lens</p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 95px; height: 61px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Normal&#x000a0;or slightly shallow</p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 119px; height: 61px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Oil droplet reflex</p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 128px; height: 61px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Localized protrusion, not global spherical change</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 48px;">
                <td style="width: 137.461px; height: 48px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Spherophakia-like lens in trauma</p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 127.539px; height: 48px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>History of trauma</p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 114px; height: 48px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Irregular lens contour</p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 95px; height: 48px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Variable</p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 119px; height: 48px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Zonular rupture</p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 128px; height: 48px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Asymmetric lens changes</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 48px;">
                <td style="width: 137.461px; height: 48px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
