</td>
                <td style="width: 140.762px; height: 48px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Markedly shallow</p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 99.2384px; height: 48px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Persistently &#x02191;</p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 126px; height: 48px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Glaucoma, complications</p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 149px; height: 48px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Surgical management</p>
</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </table-wrap>
        <p>Abbreviations: AC, anterior chamber; IOP, intraocular pressure.</p>
        <table-wrap id="article-141167.table11" position="float" orientation="portrait">
